  auth-service, Identity & Authentication, 2, Go, Fiber, Go 1.23+, distributed-network-engineer, 8081, 50052
  transcoder-service, Computational Transcoding Kernel, 3, Rust, Axum, Rust 1.80+, systems-kernel-engineer, 8082, 50053
  ai-inference-service, AI & Predictive Inference Engine, 4, Python, FastAPI, Python 3.12+, ai-inference-engineer, 8083, 50054
